    <string name="compat_mode_dialog_msg">This is a temporary workaround. It may not work, or only work partially (graphics glitches, missing textures, errors on load).\n\nIf you get save problems — colonists disappearing from your saves — download and install the <b>RimDroidSaveFix</b> mod.</string>
